{
  "name": "dsh-qwen-paint",
  "version": "0.1.5",
  "description": "(绘图)千问 · 优化版 —— 面向 DeepSeek Harness 的本地图像生成插件。经由本机 ComfyUI 调用 Qwen-Image 2.1 完成文生图与图生图，图像落盘保存并在会话中直接呈现；全部网络流量限于 127.0.0.1，无需联网与 API 密钥。本优化版在推理链路性能、显卡厂商适配（NVIDIA / Intel Arc / AMD RDNA2·3·4）与操作系统兼容（Windows / Linux）三方面进行了系统性增强。原作者 @奇迹与你，优化版 @yanfei0725。",
  "meta": {
    "title": "(绘图)千问",
    "description": "本地调用 ComfyUI 以 Qwen-Image 2.1 生成图像，图像直接呈现在会话中。优化版：推理提速、N 卡/I 卡/A 卡三厂商适配、Windows/Linux 双平台。全部流量限于本机，无需联网与密钥。"
  },
  "type": "module",
  "main": "lib/index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": {
      "default": "./lib/index.js"
    },
    "./client": {
      "default": "./lib/client.js"
    },
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "inject": [
        "slots"
      ],
      "platform": "web",
      "immediately": true
    },
    "compatibility": {
      "dsh": ">=0.2.0-rc.2",
      "node": ">=18.0.0",
      "dshReleases": {
        "0.2.0-rc.2": "compatible"
      }
    },
    "build": {
      "strategy": "none",
      "note": "lib/ 下的文件即为最终运行代码，无构建步骤、无 prepare 契约；发布副本由源码脱敏生成（本机盘符路径统一替换为占位盘符，其余字节一致）。"
    }
  },
  "files": [
    "lib",
    "assets",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "README.md",
    "INSTALL.md",
    "LICENSE"
  ],
  "keywords": [
    "dsh",
    "dsh-plugin",
    "deepseek-harness",
    "comfyui",
    "qwen-image",
    "image-generation"
  ],
  "author": "@奇迹与你",
  "contributors": [
    "@yanfei0725"
  ],
  "license": "MIT",
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "git+https://github.com/yanfei0725/dsh-qwen-paint.git"
  },
  "engines": {
    "node": ">=18.0.0"
  },
  "original": {
    "repository": "https://github.com/wonderandyou/dsh-qwen-paint",
    "author": "@奇迹与你"
  }
}
